WEBVTT

00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:04.926
<b>There was</b> a big mirror.

00:00:05.423 --> 00:00:07.294
<b>There were</b> four lamps.

00:00:09.287 --> 00:00:11.244
<b>There wasn’t</b> a TV.

00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:13.856
<b>There weren’t</b> any ghosts.

00:00:16.063 --> 00:00:17.482
<b>Was there</b> a bathroom?

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:19.607
<b>Were there</b> any windows?

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.187
Yes, <b>there was.</b>

00:00:23.691 --> 00:00:24.971
Yes, <b>there were.</b>

00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:28.739
No, <b>there wasn’t.</b>

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:30.900
No, <b>there weren’t.</b>